Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, Aryaryagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Araragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:22.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say people's names like Careless Hachibei does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that it's cuter like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it suits you surprisingly well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:36.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-san, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:39.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going out after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, to Senjougahara's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our midterms are coming up soon.\NThat's why we agreed to meet up so she can tutor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey... you still remember Senjougahara, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that tsundere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But as I recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:01:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you and Senjougahara-san are in a boy-girl relationship, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:06.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, even though you say she'll be tutoring you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:10.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,won't you just end up flirting with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just before the test that decides if you can repeat a grade or not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're actually just going to your lover's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I personally feel that's suicidal, Araragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.21,0:01:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I'm facing is whether I can graduate or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, don't say it's suicidal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I feel that it is indeed suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like I'll have to bring this issue to light and put an end to it sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That which protrudes should protrude?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to my breasts or my butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-san, what are you looking for in an elementary school student's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.\NDon't try to rub non-existent mistakes in people's faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachikuji, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is way too well arranged to be a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji, that girl, she escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's been wrong with you lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:15.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"This is way too well arranged to be a coincidence", huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems obvious, but really is hard to think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the perfect comment for the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is really what you call "witty", isn't it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:28.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was chasing after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:34.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see! You knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As expected of Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You completely saw through the actions of a novice like me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel so shy and embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, I'm still sincere in my utmost respect towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you have club activities after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:05:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you really hang around in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's okay because I hurt my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:07.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, what do you want from me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you read the world section of today's morning paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:14.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear your opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,regarding Russia's current political situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this, a current affairs joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:24.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you more interested in India's IT industry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't read the news this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-senpai,\Ndid you encounter anything weird today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like the approaching placement tests are really giving me a headache, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Later on I'm going to a study group, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Study group?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, even though it's supposedly a study group...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only me, one on one, receiving help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's really more like me being tutored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, there's someone in my class that has amazing grades...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda asking them a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Senjougahara-senpai, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about a person with good grades in your class,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it has to be Senjougahara-senpai, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There have been rumors about her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess I should go then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'll just leave for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:33.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rararagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji, don't sing out my name so musically.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is Araragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it was on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I st-stuttered!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,IT WASN'T ON PURPOSE?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, who's that person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ace of basketball; my underclassman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about three days ago she started blatantly following me around everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I have no clue what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be that she likes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the protagonist of some gal game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could I suddenly become so popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:32.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My womanly instincts are telling me I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She may confess to you in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will you do? What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't really like when people try to explain everything with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's just no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But anyway, I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,already cleared the hardest character.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like someone has said something bad about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, teaching a person to study really is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it because you're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't worried about my studies once in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I don't understand what you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I help you prepare for this placement test,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,well, at least passing won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what exactly are you thinking of doing from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you ask me about my future...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's already the end of May in your third year of high school, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said something like being fine with just graduating,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but does that mean you're going to look for a job after graduation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or does it mean that you're going to live on part time jobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or become a NEET?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you could go to a technical school to raise your qualifications first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you, my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm your lover, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My future?\NYeah, I guess you're right. I really should decide on it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on to university.\NI can probably get direct admission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if possible, I'd really like to follow the same path as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, with my grades that's a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe live together after graduation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we do that, even if our futures are different,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:10:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we'd probably have even more time together than we do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that wouldn't be bad, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be bad? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea. Let's definitely do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What exactly is "dating?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sighing quite a bit, aren't you, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you heard that every time you sigh, you lose a piece of happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'd say I've let thousands of pieces of happiness go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:31.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really care however much happiness you let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'd really appreciate it if you didn't sigh in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because it's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really say some harsh things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though I say it's annoying,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really just lovesick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you say it like that, you make it really hard to react, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, did you know, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... have never broken up with a guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I don't intend to break up with you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that basically means that neither of us know how to appeal to the other...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you still carry things like staplers around?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I guess I haven't been, recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:14.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careless, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were the ace of track and field during middle school, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:25.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to do track anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. I don't have any reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of going back to how I was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know Kanbaru Suruga?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:46.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru Suruga? Yeah.\NWhat a nostalgic name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they really were friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I mentioned the study group,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru didn't think of Hanekawa, the top in the class, first,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but thought of Senjougahara instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could that be the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she was my underclassman during middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she still? We're in the same school{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru?\NYou say it rather affectionately, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what about her, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, you recover from injuries rather quickly, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mere eyeball shouldn't be a problem then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it!\NEven if it's me, eyes are bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything to feel guilty about, and I don't think of her affectionately, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:34.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're my one and only!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so? You say rather nice things, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose I might have gotten too worked up just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I frighten you, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:55.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of these days, you are going to kill someone. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:13:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well when that time comes, I suppose I'll pick you, then.\NI'll pick you as my first opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't pick anybody but you. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want such a warped romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with it. Just accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, me killing you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,means that the one closest to you when you die will be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it romantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. I'd rather anyone kill me but you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter who I'm killed by or how I'm killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:26.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like it would be way better than being killed by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you are killed by someone other than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will kill whoever did it and screw the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we were talking about Kanbaru, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I was the track and field ace and she was the basketball ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:49.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even though we were in different grades, we still had some interaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:50.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even outside of club activities, in my private life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:14:02.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also imposed on her, or perhaps was made to look after her, many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.09,0:14:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:10.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before we get into that, why did you mention her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:10.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Care to tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's nothing to hide,\Nyou should be able to explain this to me properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Above is water, below is great fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.95,0:14:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's... the furnace that heats the bath, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong! The answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru Suruga's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do to the house of the school star?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Anyway, jokes aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, Kanbaru discovered my secret one year earlier than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was when I had just become a junior in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, right after Kanbaru started at Naoetsu High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:55.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judging from her personality, she...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,probably offered to help you, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's exactly right.\NBut I declined her offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used the same method that I used against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:11.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite that you still tried to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Kanbaru has never come close to me after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's about the extent of our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you were friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:23.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, during middle school, we were. Now is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just a complete stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though I get your relationship now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why is she following me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She must have heard that we started going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, she's curious about what kind of guy you started dating, and came to find out about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably something like that, I think.\NSorry for the trouble, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really, I guess I don't have any explanation for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:16:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could say that it's my fault for managing my interpersonal relationships improperly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she was pushed away pretty ruthlessly by you a year ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So from then on she had nothing to do with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would she really care about something like you getting a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may sound strange coming from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but to Kanbaru, I was once her idolized senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:27.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So when I pushed her away, I tried to take extra caution so as not to leave any future problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it appears that she still hasn't forgotten about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call her annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have any ill intentions, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides{\fscx250}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She {\i1}is{\i0} annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with having ill intentions or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi. Sorry for the wait. Hanekawa speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's really rare for you to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all right.\NI'm just doing some light studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Valhalla Combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They used to be known as the Valhalla Combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san from track and field and Kanbaru-san from basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Valhalla Combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Baruhara Combination?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does "Baruhara" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:40.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The "baru" is from Kanbaru and the "hara" is from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why it's "Baruhara."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:49.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it also means Valhalla, which in Norse Mythology is the hall in which the highest god, Odin, resides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the sacred hall of the god of war, where the heroes who fell in battle would be welcomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the "kami" from Kanbaru and the "senjou" from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why it's the "Valhalla Combination."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's really someone around who thinks of names like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, since they were called a combination,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they probably weren't on bad terms and didn't have too many problems, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san kept participating in her club right up to graduation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and since both of them were in sports clubs, they must have socialized, even if only a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really know everything, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know everything. I just know what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. She was popular with both the boys and girls.\NHer reputation was very good with both her seniors and classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But really, she was probably most popular with the junior girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you really wanted to ask, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it shouldn't matter to you what Senjougahara-san was like in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like the current Senjougahara-san, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:19:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liking her is good, but make sure you keep a clean and proper boy-girl relationship, okay, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san seems really serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I don't think it'll turn into a bad relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's very complicated, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.53,0:19:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to sound like I think I know her very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but she's created an impenetrable self-field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone has the self-field known as privacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but both you and Senjougahara-san lock yourselves inside like you're being besieged.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:43.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People like that tend to find socializing with others depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:50.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:53.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hating socializing with people is different than hating people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm bothereed by the very fact that people exist, but you're an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get what I mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:04.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what I want to say, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:09.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:13.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's completely normal to want to know more about your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think it's best not to dive too deep into your lover's past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let it become half interest and half amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, make sure you act in moderation in that regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can, I'd like to bring back what she has lost, what she threw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My way of thinking might be meddling in other people's business,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and it could even be said to be bothersome to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:47.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can't stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just not possible for me to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you deliver this to Oshino-san for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Oshino-san's payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.97,0:21:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you would prepare it this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you work part-time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:09.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I helped somewhat with my father's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, to be precise, I should say I forced him to let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how I got the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She trusted me with it, and I forgot it at her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.93,0:23:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This isn't Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I'm not Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.89,0:23:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well then, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.81,0:24:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{[Dejigarubi tte digitaru janai na}Daegi Galbi isn't digital.{Daegi Galbi is Korean for Pork Ribs, and is a specific type of dish.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Robounoishi roboto janai yo ne}Roadside stones aren't robots.{Unsure}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Ranking ichi demo kingu janai}The top ranking is not the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.07,0:24:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Overhaul ha ana janai}An overhaul isn't a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.65,0:24:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{?Schedule tte netsuryou janai ze}A schedule isn't a joule!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Eroqution ha ero janai no}Elocution isn't erotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Mi ni amaru kouei mini na koe nanoka sou janai no ka}An undeserved honor isn't the same as a small honor at all, is it?{Still not completely sure}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.91,0:24:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Chouai ukeru - chou ai ukeru no sou janai yo}Getting favor isn't the same as getting super lovey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.49,0:24:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Ja nai yo na?}It really isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.41,0:24:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{Jai nai yo ne}Really, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.33,0:24:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Preview quiz!\N{\be1}Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Not!\N{\be1}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.08,0:24:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Next time, Suruga Monkey Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:22.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So if it's not a quiz, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.63,0:24:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a quiz...
